# Everything the image builds for itself, plus what it never needs.
#
# priv/ is excluded piecemeal, not wholesale: priv/csqlite and priv/web
# are build outputs (gitignored, rebuilt in-stage — a host-built csqlite
# could be the wrong architecture), but priv/tuf is a tracked source
# file, the TUF anchor the shipment stage COPYs in. Excluding all of
# priv/ once shipped an image with no anchor, which is a boot-time
# "priv/tuf is missing from this build" and no Rekor discovery.
#
# `*.md` below is for the prose at the top of this directory, and it
# would take priv/skill/SKILL.md with it — the one .md the image serves —
# so that path is exempted after it.
build/
priv/csqlite
priv/web/
web/node_modules/
web/dist/
e2e/
test/
ops/
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
.git/
erl_crash.dump
*.md
!priv/skill/SKILL.md
